#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:3
#: 59f2df16dc8d466888f41822a233bcd9
msgid "插隙与吸附（Interstitial & Adsorbate）"
msgstr "Interstitial & Adsorbate"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:5
#: cee1b4292d6b426a8e243026c1d6e499
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:7
#: 8f4ba552b1364bd499b0491f2ac20a1a
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:9
#: 21cdcf1398a1428985fdc098cacaa367
msgid "在已有结构中随机加入原子，并为每个输入生成多份候选："
msgstr ""
"Randomly add atoms to an existing structure and generate multiple candidates for each"
" input:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:11
#: 9d42a6da19a44305875a6b9af6c9e5dc
msgid "**体相随机插隙**：在整个周期晶胞内均匀取点。"
msgstr "**Random bulk interstitials:** sample points uniformly throughout the periodic cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:12
#: d3e9aa9ad4a349aa83b60054f566c5bc
msgid "**上表面随机吸附**：在指定晶格方向的上表面随机取横向位置，并放到最高原子平面上方。"
msgstr ""
"**Random upper-surface adsorption:** sample lateral positions on the upper surface "
"along a selected lattice direction and place atoms above the highest atomic plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:14
#: 55906962c7a54969ada37af7a433f7bf
msgid "两种模式都要求新原子与宿主原子、同一输出中先加入的原子保持最小距离。"
msgstr ""
"Both modes require each new atom to maintain a minimum distance from the host atoms "
"and from atoms already added to the same output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:17
#: 3534cbf3db9349d5b979a820ab8c0ad8
msgid "体相模式会采样**整个晶胞**。若输入是带真空层的 slab，真空区域也会被采样；此时通常应选上表面吸附模式。"
msgstr ""
"Bulk mode samples the **entire cell**. If the input is a slab containing vacuum, "
"points in the vacuum region are sampled as well; upper-surface adsorption mode is "
"usually the appropriate choice in that case."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:20
#: da784821797e4d31becdf2ad6ae8dd6e
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:22
#: 279e4d8fdcef45a4b73e5cca6ff06483
msgid "体相随机插隙"
msgstr "Random bulk interstitials"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:24
#: d964edcc616d493ca0b002f34be18f7f
msgid "程序从单位分数坐标晶胞中均匀抽样"
msgstr "The program samples uniformly from the unit cell in fractional coordinates:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:26
#: d4bc6e3bc6a74d97838612ca4d01e676
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf s\\sim U([0,1)^3),\\qquad \\mathbf r=\\mathbf s\\mathbf A,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:30
#: 90a6c184c3154137af332b7e7be20c18
msgid "其中 $\\mathbf A$ 是输入晶胞矩阵。候选位置通过距离检查后才会加入。"
msgstr ""
"where $\\mathbf A$ is the input cell matrix. A candidate position is added only after"
" it passes the distance check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:32
#: d1808b640fcb4fe999bc77f5162ee24a
msgid "上表面随机吸附"
msgstr "Random upper-surface adsorption"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:34
#: cc75d6394fe24687bbd805c0bf4a66fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`真空方向`选择包含真空层的晶格方向 $i\\in\\{a,b,c\\}$。程序沿另外两个分数坐标方向随机取点，以原始宿主的最高原子平面为基准，再沿真实表面法向移动 "
"`吸附高度`。"
msgstr ""
"`Vacuum direction` selects the lattice direction $i\\in\\{a,b,c\\}$ that contains the"
" vacuum layer. The program samples random points along the other two fractional-"
"coordinate directions, references the highest atomic plane of the original host, and "
"then moves by `Adsorption height` along the true surface normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:36
#: dad6ceed771649bd99e41f78dcc03407
msgid "倾斜晶胞中的法向来自倒易方向"
msgstr "For a tilted cell, the normal is obtained from the reciprocal direction:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:38
#: 4d51355fc7bc4974a5dee484ff660e60
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf n_i=\\frac{\\mathbf A^{-T}\\mathbf e_i}\n"
"{\\lVert\\mathbf A^{-T}\\mathbf e_i\\rVert},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:43
#: 51eedaceae78400ab1d78f14b2a5b523
msgid "因此选择晶格 `c` 并不等于固定沿笛卡尔 `z` 移动。"
msgstr "Thus, selecting lattice direction `c` does not mean moving along Cartesian `z`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:45
#: 3a2bce55016c4bc69247be8d1a8fcb65
msgid "距离与输出数量"
msgstr "Distances and Output Counts"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:47
#: d451aed77cc94ed2a11c8a5c1e5a13a6
msgid "每个候选位置都必须满足"
msgstr "Every candidate position must satisfy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:49
#: 17dbac0cee1647868fbb43388310659b
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\min_j d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}(\\mathbf r,\\mathbf r_j)\\ge d_{\\min},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:53
#: 1ebaf68d93bd457cb5f9c79f8626866d
msgid "其中 $d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 按输入结构的周期边界计算，$\\mathbf r_j$ 包含宿主原子及本次已经加入的原子。"
msgstr ""
"Here $d_{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ is computed using the periodic boundaries of the input "
"structure, and $\\mathbf r_j$ includes both host atoms and atoms already added in the"
" current output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:55
#: 273d021aeffc4af0abd968160cc3349d
#, python-brace-format
msgid "若输入结构数为 $N_\\mathrm{in}$，`每个输入的输出数`为 $N_\\mathrm{per}$，则"
msgstr ""
"If the number of input structures is $N_\\mathrm{in}$ and `Outputs per input` is "
"$N_\\mathrm{per}$, then"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:57
#: 65941a8c61dc4969ae722efcab80606f
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{out}=N_\\mathrm{in}\\times N_\\mathrm{per}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:61
#: 948b251d64ba4d4185bf3bc4a59714cc
msgid "每个成功输出的原子数为"
msgstr "The atom count of each successful output is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:63
#: 5f3b69215acd44d2a6d3506bdaec9bcf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_\\mathrm{atoms,out}=N_\\mathrm{atoms,in}+N_\\mathrm{insert}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:67
#: 62b1beb0276b4856aee0bd9536809a18
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:69
#: 180f6ff745af4b60ae4573152c79bc08
msgid "放置方式"
msgstr "Placement Method"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:71
#: 1106a5029e02474eb5450e35bc8a518e
msgid "插入模式（mode）"
msgstr "mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:73
#: 2b6dd5245d0845eaaa24a88af7fc295d
msgid "默认体相随机插隙；切换到上表面吸附后，界面会显示真空方向和吸附高度。"
msgstr ""
"The default is random bulk interstitial placement. After switching to upper-surface "
"adsorption, the interface displays the vacuum direction and adsorption height."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:75
#: 83c0f28e55db46fc82c1c16b1b2873a8
msgid "插入元素与权重（species）"
msgstr "species"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:77
#: 1b2f18d248424076845c5c2932d575a6
msgid ""
"必填。可输入单元素 `Li`，也可输入 `Li:7, Na:3`。后者表示每次加入一个原子时分别以 70% 和 30% 的概率选择 "
"Li、Na；多个原子逐个独立抽样，不保证单个输出严格保持 7:3。"
msgstr ""
"Required. Enter a single element such as `Li`, or weighted species such as `Li:7, "
"Na:3`. In the latter case, each added atom is independently chosen as Li with 70% "
"probability or Na with 30% probability; an individual output is not guaranteed to "
"have an exact 7:3 ratio."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:79
#: bd62f9d3d8ac4dc3a17dd735039ccdf7
msgid "真空方向（axis）"
msgstr "Vacuum Direction (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:81
#: be9486c65b514fa6b95952b2e3af8d83
msgid "默认晶格 `c`，仅吸附模式生效。选择 slab 真空层所在的晶格 `a`、`b` 或 `c`，不是笛卡尔 `x`、`y`、`z`。"
msgstr ""
"Lattice direction `c` by default; used only in adsorption mode. Select the lattice "
"direction `a`, `b`, or `c` that contains the slab vacuum, not Cartesian `x`, `y`, or "
"`z`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:83
#: 7fc8ab73c15847849a343005196779ee
msgid "吸附高度（offset）"
msgstr "Adsorption Height (offset)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:85
#: d14e90de2a8e4976a1bdb4977d29ec64
msgid "默认 `1.5 Å`，仅吸附模式生效。它是新原子到原始宿主最高原子平面的真实法向距离。"
msgstr ""
"Default `1.5 Å`, used only in adsorption mode. This is the true normal distance from "
"the new atom to the highest atomic plane of the original host."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:87
#: e883f50bd29e40a790553fcfcc917d7a
msgid "数量与距离"
msgstr "Counts and Distance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:89
#: 2040e860557f4ce2821ffa37710725cd
msgid "每个输出插入原子数（insert_count）"
msgstr "insert_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:91
#: 19709823ab5040d7bd03dbfd0a2059a3
msgid "默认 `1`。每个成功输出必须完整新增的原子数。"
msgstr ""
"Default `1`. The number of atoms that must be added in full to every successful "
"output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:93
#: 91e9c79d56514763b4717ed15f94f06b
msgid "每个输入的输出数（structure_count）"
msgstr "structure_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:95
#: e639bc20d1634c718e0d3619e5b625e8
msgid "默认 `10`。总输出数等于输入数乘以该值。"
msgstr "Default `10`. The total output count equals the input count multiplied by this value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:97
#: 3a01d193afac43808703d941c516162b
msgid "最小原子间距（min_distance）"
msgstr "min_distance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:99
#: 11a8db603e26401d9048bf893e1a2e7c
msgid "默认 `1.4 Å`。同时约束新原子到宿主原子以及本次先加入原子的距离。"
msgstr ""
"Default `1.4 Å`. This constrains both the distance from a new atom to host atoms and "
"its distance to atoms added earlier in the same output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:101
#: b47cf78d1c8a41859ba0bbcdcd57cb21
msgid "随机性与搜索"
msgstr "Randomness and Search"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:103
#: 2ab81b7a921a40f995e8a675dd465269
msgid "放置尝试次数（max_attempts）"
msgstr "Placement Attempts (max_attempts)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:105
#: 20a594ba225545f8ba901eac82fd7761
msgid "默认 `200`，位于高级设置。它只增加随机搜索预算，不改变距离条件。"
msgstr ""
"Default `200`, under advanced settings. It increases only the random-search budget "
"and does not change the distance criterion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:107
#: 99cea4d8d07747eebc7c22b4ec0232f5
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:109
#: 7cef0ed12edf4a2a8f1bbed1dc448543
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，同一输入和同一组参数可以复现元素与位置抽样。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, species and position sampling are reproducible for"
" the same input and parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:111
#: 09effa8808af497e9a916ceaf4e093dd
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:113
#: 20d46e98ed3c414f95ff4bd7cd922c7a
msgid "默认 `0`，仅在启用随机种子时生效；不同输入结构仍会派生各自的采样序列。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0`, used only when random seeding is enabled. Different input structures "
"still derive their own sampling sequences."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:115
#: 363f2376f3254ca7a8c82ba41b58d8d8
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:117
#: 00ae1da8fe8e42339d55edb25e204129
msgid "生成 O 上表面吸附候选"
msgstr "Generate Upper-Surface O Adsorption Candidates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:119
#: ce24184a725246abba5b21a7d27978ea
msgid "输入是一组真空沿晶格 `c` 的 slab，希望每个输入生成 50 个候选："
msgstr ""
"The inputs are slabs whose vacuum lies along lattice direction `c`, and 50 candidates"
" are required for each input:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:121
#: 8935aa1ea93447c1af8a9265c40812f6
msgid "选择 `上表面随机吸附`。"
msgstr "Select `Random upper-surface adsorption`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:122
#: a9bff3b7fca84373aeeaecb736b78f57
msgid "填写元素 `O`，每个输出插入 `1` 个原子。"
msgstr "Enter element `O` and insert `1` atom per output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:123
#: 4930843422f74dff8e0b022102db729e
msgid "将每个输入的输出数设为 `50`，最小距离设为 `1.4 Å`。"
msgstr "Set outputs per input to `50` and the minimum distance to `1.4 Å`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:124
#: 8c8c03051f8c4b819b61573c8f4db5b3
msgid "选择真空方向 `c`，吸附高度设为 `1.8 Å`。"
msgstr "Select vacuum direction `c` and set the adsorption height to `1.8 Å`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:125
#: 48ab3f6dbd174b098f76e76509ed8937
msgid "如需复现实验，开启随机种子。"
msgstr "Enable the random seed if the experiment must be reproduced."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:127
#: 422642d3ce744bf49c02447221778c60
msgid "若载入 8 个输入，界面会预览 `8 × 50 = 400` 个输出；每个输出比对应输入多一个 O 原子。"
msgstr ""
"With eight inputs loaded, the interface previews `8 × 50 = 400` outputs; each output "
"contains one more O atom than its corresponding input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:129
#: 463cb9c97e154b33ab478533111c8658
msgid "失败时会发生什么"
msgstr "What Happens on Failure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:131
#: 401b8bf27efb4e6c98b24a92f9980a8d
msgid "每个输出必须完整加入指定数量的原子。若某个原子在尝试次数内始终找不到满足最小距离的位置，操作会报错，不会把未修改或只插入一部分的结构当作成功输出。"
msgstr ""
"Every output must receive the full requested number of atoms. If a valid position "
"satisfying the minimum distance cannot be found for an atom within the attempt limit,"
" the operation reports an error. It does not treat an unchanged or partially inserted"
" structure as a successful output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:133
#: 8e4e5127d65440f69cff7a37339aacb8
msgid "优先检查："
msgstr "Check the following first:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:135
#: bfde369d6fbb4246a6d496370bcc3872
msgid "最小距离是否过大；"
msgstr "whether the minimum distance is too large;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:136
#: cd3f2065848242e6bd515b76661d147b
msgid "晶胞可用空间是否太小；"
msgstr "whether the available space in the cell is too small;"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:137
#: 7ae4b903868a4bbc82f0951efdd683c0
msgid "每个输出插入的原子是否太多。"
msgstr "whether too many atoms are requested per output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:139
#: 68f3604c1a094cb7865afa61fa771862
msgid "确认几何条件合理后，再考虑提高高级设置中的尝试次数。"
msgstr ""
"Only after confirming that the geometry is feasible should you consider increasing "
"the attempt count under advanced settings."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:141
#: 7f25bea59e3d4cc58823c680029cc4c0
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:143
#: 9824c0cf0d4147aa973a3c722e5b5eeb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "体相插隙标签：`Ins(int,n={插入数})`"
msgstr "Bulk interstitial label: `Ins(int,n={inserted count})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:144
#: 9824c0cf0d4147aa973a3c722e5b5eeb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "上表面吸附标签：`Ins(ad,n={插入数})`"
msgstr "Upper-surface adsorption label: `Ins(ad,n={inserted count})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:146
#: 96b29cfd8d2740b0902a69bdd486405f
msgid "吸附模式保持原晶胞不变，因此应确保表面上方已有足够真空容纳新原子。"
msgstr ""
"Adsorption mode leaves the original cell unchanged, so ensure that sufficient vacuum "
"already exists above the surface to accommodate the new atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:148
#: e35685bc02cf40e49877de94cc5e8557
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:150
#: 0d5bead89af14dcfb04a9c4f654fa2c2
msgid "**为什么体相插隙出现在 slab 真空层中？**"
msgstr "**Why do bulk interstitials appear in a slab's vacuum region?**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:152
#: 3488f21ed63d4cf8837a5c280c198880
msgid "体相模式均匀采样整个晶胞。对 slab 请改用上表面吸附模式，并选择正确的真空方向。"
msgstr ""
"Bulk mode samples the entire cell uniformly. For a slab, use upper-surface adsorption"
" mode and select the correct vacuum direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:154
#: a2ae9ad3201e41e180c9b90af20472a6
msgid "**为什么提高尝试次数后仍然失败？**"
msgstr "**Why does placement still fail after increasing the attempt count?**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/interstitial-adsorbate-card.md:156
