msgid "尝试次数不会放宽最小距离。应先检查晶胞空间、插入数量和最小距离是否相容。"
msgstr ""
"More attempts do not relax the minimum distance. First check whether the cell space, "
"insertion count, and minimum distance are mutually compatible."

#~ msgid "插隙/吸附缺陷（Insert Defect）"
#~ msgstr "Interstitial and Adsorbate Defects (Insert Defect)"

#~ msgid "在体相或表面结构中随机插入额外原子。支持 Interstitial（体相间隙位插入）和 Adsorption（表面吸附位放置）两种模式，用最小距离约束避免原子碰撞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Randomly add atoms to bulk or surface "
#~ "structures. Interstitial mode places atoms at "
#~ "candidate sites inside a bulk cell, while "
#~ "Adsorption mode places them above a surface."
#~ " A minimum-distance constraint prevents direct"
#~ " atomic overlap."

#~ msgid "场景：模型对 Li 扩散路径预测完全错误"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: the model predicts an incorrect Li diffusion pathway"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 LiCoO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型跑 Li 扩散。模型预测的扩散势垒比 "
#~ "DFT 低了一半——中间态的能量被严重低估。检查训练集发现：所有结构里 Li 都待在八面体位点，从来没见过 Li"
#~ " 在四面体间隙位的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model for Li "
#~ "diffusion in LiCoO2. Its predicted diffusion "
#~ "barrier is only half the DFT value "
#~ "because the intermediate states are severely "
#~ "underestimated. Inspection shows that every training"
#~ " structure places Li at an octahedral site;"
#~ " none contains Li near a tetrahedral "
#~ "interstitial site."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 扩散路径上的过渡态对应 Li "
#~ "从一个八面体位穿过四面体间隙位跃迁到相邻八面体位的过程。训练集里只有基态构型，模型自然会低估中间态能量。需要往训练集里加入 Li "
#~ "在四面体间隙位附近的构型，让模型见过这些局域环境。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Along this diffusion path, Li "
#~ "moves from one octahedral site to the "
#~ "next through a tetrahedral interstitial region. "
#~ "A training set that contains only ground-"
#~ "state occupations gives the model no "
#~ "information about those intermediate local "
#~ "environments. Add configurations with Li near "
#~ "tetrahedral interstitial sites so the model "
#~ "can learn their energies."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 超胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A LiCoO2 supercell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 在体相中插入单个 Li 原子于随机间隙位，生成 50 个候选构型"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Generate 50 candidates by inserting "
#~ "one Li atom at a random interstitial "
#~ "position in the bulk cell."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

