#~ msgid ""
#~ "`真空／表面法向方向`（`axis`）指定 slab 真空所在的晶格方向 `a`、`b` 或 "
#~ "`c`。程序以原始宿主原子的最大分数坐标确定上表面，在该平面内随机取点，再沿真实表面法向移动 `高于最高原子平面的距离`（`offset`）。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vacuum/surface-normal direction` (`axis`) selects "
#~ "the lattice direction `a`, `b`, or `c` "
#~ "containing the slab vacuum. The program "
#~ "locates the upper surface from the maximum "
#~ "fractional coordinate of the original host "
#~ "atoms, samples a point in that plane, "
#~ "and moves it along the true surface "
#~ "normal by `Distance above the highest atomic"
#~ " plane` (`offset`)."

#~ msgid "对于倾斜晶胞，法向由对应的倒易方向计算，而不是直接沿晶格矢量移动。多个吸附原子始终以同一个原始宿主平面为参考，不会逐个向上堆叠。当前只生成上表面候选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "For a tilted cell, the normal is "
#~ "computed from the corresponding reciprocal direction"
#~ " rather than by moving directly along a "
#~ "lattice vector. Multiple adsorbates always use "
#~ "the same original host plane as the "
#~ "reference; they are not stacked upward one "
#~ "by one. Only upper-surface candidates are "
#~ "generated."

