#~ msgid "模式与元素"
#~ msgstr "Modes and elements"

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `0`。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `0`."

#~ msgid "`0`：体相随机插隙，在整个晶胞内连续随机取点。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`0`: random bulk interstitials, with continuous "
#~ "random sampling throughout the cell."

#~ msgid "`1`：上表面随机吸附，在指定上表面随机取横向位置。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`1`: random upper-surface adsorption, with "
#~ "random lateral positions on the selected upper"
#~ " surface."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空，运行时必填。可填写单一元素 `Li`，或使用相对权重 `Li:7, "
#~ "Na:3`。多个插入原子会分别独立抽样，因此权重表示概率，不保证单个输出达到精确组成。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default empty and required at run "
#~ "time. Enter a single element such as "
#~ "`Li`, or relative weights such as `Li:7, "
#~ "Na:3`. Multiple inserted atoms are sampled "
#~ "independently, so weights represent probabilities "
#~ "and do not guarantee an exact composition "
#~ "in each output."

#~ msgid "元素符号必须有效，权重必须为有限正数。重复元素的权重会合并。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Element symbols must be valid and weights "
#~ "must be finite positive numbers. Weights for"
#~ " duplicate elements are merged."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `10`。每个输入结构生成的完整输出数，界面范围为 1–1000。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `10`. Number of complete "
#~ "outputs generated per input structure; the UI"
#~ " range is 1–1000."

#~ msgid "几何与尝试预算"
#~ msgstr "Geometry and attempt budget"

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 `1.4 Å`。候选点到宿主原子和已插入原子的最小允许距离。必须为有限正数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `1.4 Å`. Minimum allowed "
#~ "distance from a candidate point to host "
#~ "atoms and already inserted atoms. It must "
#~ "be finite and positive."

#~ msgid "该值只排除明显近距离碰撞，不代表化学合理的键长。不同元素体系应按原子尺寸和预期局域环境调整。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This value only excludes obvious close "
#~ "collisions; it is not a chemically reasonable"
#~ " bond length. Adjust it for the atomic "
#~ "sizes and expected local environments of the"
#~ " elements involved."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `200`。每个待插入原子的最大随机尝试次数。达到上限仍找不到满足距离的位置时，整个操作报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `200`. Maximum random attempts "
#~ "for each atom to be inserted. If no "
#~ "position satisfying the distance constraint is "
#~ "found by the limit, the whole operation "
#~ "fails."

#~ msgid "连续触发上限通常说明晶胞过密、插入数过多或 `最小原子间距`（`min_distance`）过大；单纯继续提高尝试次数未必有效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Repeatedly reaching the limit usually indicates "
#~ "an overcrowded cell, too many insertions, or"
#~ " an overly large `Minimum interatomic distance`"
#~ " (`min_distance`); simply increasing the attempt "
#~ "count may not help."

#~ msgid "表面吸附"
#~ msgstr "Surface adsorption"

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `2`，仅在吸附模式生效。"
#~ msgstr "`int`, default `2`, used only in adsorption mode."

#~ msgid "`0`：真空沿晶格 `a`"
#~ msgstr "`0`: vacuum along lattice direction `a`"

#~ msgid "`1`：真空沿晶格 `b`"
#~ msgstr "`1`: vacuum along lattice direction `b`"

#~ msgid "`2`：真空沿晶格 `c`"
#~ msgstr "`2`: vacuum along lattice direction `c`"

#~ msgid "这里选择的是晶格方向，不等同于笛卡尔 `x`、`y`、`z`。程序会据此计算真实表面法向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This selects a lattice direction, not a "
#~ "Cartesian `x`, `y`, or `z` axis. The "
#~ "program uses it to compute the true "
#~ "surface normal."

#~ msgid "高于最高原子平面的距离（offset）"
#~ msgstr "offset"

#~ msgid "该参数不会自动扩大晶胞。应先确保 slab 有足够真空容纳吸附原子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This parameter does not enlarge the cell "
#~ "automatically. Ensure that the slab has enough"
#~ " vacuum to contain the adsorbates."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。启用后可复现同一输入结构的元素选择和几何位置。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, element "
#~ "choices and geometric positions are reproducible "
#~ "for the same input structure."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。种子会与结构内容共同派生，因此几何不同的输入帧不会机械地获得相同分数坐标。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `0`, used only when "
#~ "`use_seed=true`. The seed is derived together "
#~ "with the structure content, so geometrically "
#~ "different input frames do not mechanically "
#~ "receive the same fractional coordinates."

