#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Insert Defect` → `FPS Filter`: screen a "
#~ "large candidate pool by descriptors before "
#~ "expensive calculations."

#~ msgid "**为什么没有四面体或八面体位点选项？**"
#~ msgstr "**Why are there no tetrahedral or octahedral site options?**"

#~ msgid "当前算法不做晶体学位点识别，只在连续空间随机采样。需要确定间隙位时，应使用专门的位点生成方法。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The current algorithm does not identify "
#~ "crystallographic sites; it samples randomly in "
#~ "continuous space. Use a dedicated site-"
#~ "generation method when a specific interstitial "
#~ "site is required."

#~ msgid "**为什么运行直接报“无法放置”？**"
#~ msgstr "**Why does the run report “unable to place atom”?**"

#~ msgid "卡片不会返回插入数不足的结构。先检查 `最小原子间距`（`min_distance`）、插入原子数和晶胞可用空间，再决定是否增加尝试次数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The card does not return structures with "
#~ "too few insertions. Check `Minimum interatomic "
#~ "distance` (`min_distance`), the insertion count, and"
#~ " available cell space before increasing the "
#~ "attempt count."

#~ msgid "**为什么吸附原子可能位于晶胞范围外？**"
#~ msgstr "**Why can an adsorbate lie outside the cell bounds?**"

#~ msgid "卡片保持原晶胞和宿主坐标不变，也不会静默包裹吸附原子。请先在表面法向留出足够真空，或在后续计算前明确扩展晶胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The card keeps the original cell and "
#~ "host coordinates unchanged and does not "
#~ "silently wrap adsorbates. Leave enough vacuum "
#~ "along the surface normal, or explicitly "
#~ "enlarge the cell before subsequent calculations."

#~ msgid "**如何生成下表面吸附？**"
#~ msgstr "**How can I generate lower-surface adsorption?**"

#~ msgid "当前只生成所选晶格方向的上表面。可先翻转 slab，或使用明确支持上下表面的专门工具。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Only the upper surface along the selected "
#~ "lattice direction is generated. Flip the slab"
#~ " first, or use a dedicated tool that "
#~ "explicitly supports both surfaces."

